# photo originals: 6-9MB PNGs straight out of the generator. scripts/prep-photos.mjs
# turns each into the ~100KB JPEG that actually ships. Keep them locally for
# re-cropping; never commit them.
#
# They live outside public/ deliberately: public/ is the web root and Astro
# copies all of it into dist/, so 125MB of PNGs was being written into every
# local build alongside the 1.8MB the site actually uses.
photo-originals/
